  "description": "Are you ready for maximum speed on gravel, forest trails and asphalt? With the anniversary model Machete RX 1, BULLS offers you the best possible performance combined with the versatility of a gravel bike. The Machete RX series was developed with BULLS team rider Alban Lakata specifically for the Gravel World Cup and is accordingly tailored for racing.\n\nAt its heart is a powerful carbon frame with character and smart details such as semi-internal cable routing through the head tube, an integrated seat clamp with cover and a mounting point for a derailleur for conversion to 2X drivetrain. In terms of equipment, the Machete RX 1 offers outstanding value for money and has no weaknesses. Instead, it boasts highlights and details such as the beautifully designed carbon fork, Shimano GRX 12-speed gears and UDH derailleur hanger.",
